Cell["\<\
This example is the same as the last one, but with difference in details. (1) \
the equations of motion contain a function f[z]. (2) There are singularities \
at z=1. (3) The equations are saved to a file.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.404664273517308*^9, 3.404664427064627*^9}, {
  3.404664461213721*^9, 3.404664477562335*^9}, {3.4609060050249*^9, 
