Cell["\<\
In the above example, cheb[x, 8] can be cheb[u, 8], then the variable will be \
u, and differential matrix is du and duu.     id is the idensity matrix, zero \
is the zero matrix, and one is a vector of 1\[CloseCurlyQuote]s.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7388259097615747`*^9, 3.7388259739206467`*^9}, {
