Cell["\<\
linearMap[{x1, x2} -> {y1, y2}] generates a pure function that linearly maps \
the interval (x1, x2) to (y1, y2). linearMap[{x1, x2}] generates a pure \
function that linearly maps the interval (x1, x2) to (-1, 1).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.738827704970062*^9, 
  3.738827900569443*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4942098d-1e8d-48ff-a45c-\
